  "disclaimer_extra": "Panda Express publishes each side, entrée and sauce separately rather than as finished Bowls or Plates, so every value here is a component as printed. Portions are the standard serving: on a two- or three-entrée Plate the side is served smaller than the listed portion. Kids' Cub Meal portions and the beverage list are published but not included here. Items marked Regional are the ones Panda flags as regional or limited-time, so your restaurant may not carry them.",
  "blurb": "Build your Panda Express order the way you order it — pick a side, then your entrées — and watch the calories and macros add up.",
